  - Move NPC2 towards the closest spot to them
  - Move towards the farthest spot to you
  - Move to the middle point between SpotA and SpotB
  - Move to spotA then to SpotB and say what you are doing at each step
  - Go and grab the phone
  - Place the item you grabbed on the closest object
  - place all the items scattered around on top of the drawer
  - place the phone and the brick on top of the table using both npcs
  - hi
  - Fly off into space ang give me a rock
  - NPC1 give the phone to NPC2
